 {
  "id": 29500,
  "date_gmt": "2026-05-27T19:09:25",
  "title": {
   "rendered": "live&#038;direct &#8211; Albert Fikáček (Jindřichohradecké úzkokolejky)"
  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "<p>Na jihu Čech se po letech spánku probudil technický unikát. Úzkorozchodná železnice, která spojuje Jindřichův Hradec s Obrataní a Novou Bystřicí. A právě z Nové Bystřice bylo naše další Live/Direct. Klíčovou postavou pro oživení úzkokolejky je Albert Fikáček a právě s ním si povídal <a href=\"https://slowdownradijo.cz/members/dj-cube-positive/\">DJ cube positive</a>.</p>\n<p>DJ cube positive každou neděli od 20 do 22 v rámci pořadu <a href=\"https://slowdownradijo.cz/shows/weekend-aftertaste-s-cube-positive/\">Weekend Aftertaste</a></p>\n<p><iframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N-7cUA1zBaI?si=EPEQGjpG_Es2ZZg1\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29503\" src=\"https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-1-770x578.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"770\" height=\"578\" srcset=\"https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-1-770x578.jpg 770w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-1-1170x878.jpg 1170w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-1-16x12.jpg 16w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-1.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29502\" src=\"https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-2-770x578.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"770\" height=\"578\" srcset=\"https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-2-770x578.jpg 770w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-2-1170x878.jpg 1170w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-2-768x576.jpg 768w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-2-16x12.jpg 16w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-2.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29501\" src=\"https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-3-770x578.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"770\" height=\"578\" srcset=\"https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-3-770x578.jpg 770w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-3-1170x878.jpg 1170w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-3-768x576.jpg 768w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-3-16x12.jpg 16w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-3.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29504\" src=\"https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-4-770x578.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"770\" height=\"578\" srcset=\"https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-4-770x578.jpg 770w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-4-1170x878.jpg 1170w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-4-768x576.jpg 768w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-4-16x12.jpg 16w, https://slowdownradijo.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Jindrichohradecke-uzkokolejky-4.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\" /></p>\n",
